rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他聘请她担任翻译。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通用</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（语言、货币等的）通用；流通；使用；（票证等）有效；被接受；行得通；成立；适用；有效；通过；进出；出入</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101366\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>年<rp>(</rp><rt>とし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>割<rp>(</rp><rt>わり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>若<rp>(</rp><rt>わか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えるので、<ruby>大学生<rp>(</rp><rt>だいがくせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>として<ruby>通用<rp>(</rp><rt>つうよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>します。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他看起来这么年轻, 以至于他通过一个大学生。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通路</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つうろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">通道；过道；走廊；路径</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218942\">これが<ruby>海<rp>(</rp><rt>うみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>への<ruby>通路<rp>(</rp><rt>つうろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是通往大海的通道。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/338639\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">杖</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拐杖；手杖；杖；魔杖</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146033\"><ruby>杖<rp>(</rp><rt>つえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>役<rp>(</rp><rt>やく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にも<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那根棍子帮不了他</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遣い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">差使；差事；跑腿；使者；信使；跑腿的人；使灵；役灵；使用；用法；使用者；驯兽师；驭手；耍蛇人等操纵者（作后缀时常读「づかい」）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">使い道</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つかいみち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">用途；目的；用处；使用方法；用法</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"108230\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>使<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>道<rp>(</rp><rt>みち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>困<rp>(</rp><rt>こま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他不知道怎么用他的钱</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">使う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つかう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><