span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">疲れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つかれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">疲劳；疲倦；倦怠</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"93344\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいくぶん<ruby>疲<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れを<ruby>感<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她觉得有点累了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">疲れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つかれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">疲劳；疲倦；劳累；疲惫；磨损；磨旧；挨饿；饥饿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"177623\">とても<ruby>疲<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れているように<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你看起来很累</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">つき</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">月亮；月球；月份；月；月光；月色；（天体的）卫星；自然卫星</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195286\">まもなく<ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>つき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>旅行<rp>(</rp><rt>りょこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>出来<rp>(</rp><rt>でき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るだろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们很快就能去月球了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">付き</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つき</span>