rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>倒<rp>(</rp><rt>たお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这些小屋一个接一个地被炸毁。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">継ぎ目</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つぎめ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">接缝；接头；接合处</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229126\">いすの<ruby>継<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎ<ruby>目<rp>(</rp><rt>め</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はぐらぐらしていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">椅子的关节松了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">付く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">附着；粘上；贴住；黏附；留下痕迹；留疤；着色；染色；结出（果实）；产生（利息）；习得；获得；增强；扎根；生根；陪同；随行；跟随；师从；站在…一边；属于；附身；缠绕；着火；点着；（灯）亮起；（电器）开着；敲定；解决；决定；被起名；被定价；被感知；被察觉；走运；幸运；变成；成为</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228192\">うちの<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはエアコンが<ruby>付<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们的车配备了空调。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/785127\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">吐く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class